<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- Ekajuk New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Jud</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jud</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jud</para>
  <para style="mt2">NWER NYI</para>
  <para style="mt1">JUD</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Me Jud wo, ji li nlokeltum no Jisos Kraist, me ji li mmonannyehn Jems,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 13:55</char></note> n kpꞌnyono nwer nyia tv ane ba Esowo ma lung bo, bo jio ji kpo kor Esowo Nsoo, bi ma-n kuuru bum Jisos Kraist.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 17:6</char></note><verse eid="JUD 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Nong, Esowo kpe-n budu ndon enye gbalee, a elkoono, go elkoro.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akimfahnge atꞌtibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Akpondahme enyame, sahb kor-m kor re me n nyon tv-n bade eltahre ni e ma bel jang jang egom egom. Anv, me n seb kahn re, ga li re me n nyon nwer tv-n, nyi m bahk-n rehke re wahn nok ka etingitingi ji Esowo ma si yꞌyake kak ane ebe go ebo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 1:27</char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Tibre egom ane bandiki ba Esowo kil jo lub bo, ebba roongo yel go ero.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 2:4</char></note> Bobfere yaange nnoobo nyi Esowo ebahre, kpꞌtaame re ane jo famme yannge. Bobten Jisos Kraist Ntul ewahre no li ntubesi ewahre ntahngtahng. Esowo nyono wuku wuku re, bo bahke lehke ebi jio.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Jol eji ḿ ma kꞌkahn nsol nyia kpee, n kpꞌsebe re me m buum-n ana Jehova tahre abon Israel, yehke go ndi nyi Ijib. Eji ma kang, á rꞌrannge ane ba ki taame.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 10:5</char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Babenjel fvfo ba ki ma tob kuuru etul ebo, eji bo ta nnyab, tahm adi ellene ebo sa, Esowo kꞌkak bo agbekobo nya bo lꞌkꞌma lohng go njinanjini, fere kpi bo kuuru go edi ejannge, kpꞌsiki egburu efung elam.<verse eid="JUD 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Sodom, a Gomorra,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Pit 2:6</char></note> a ajahbe nya jolo sennge bo kak jo limi eljini ana ni enjel nyao jo lim. Bo yake elbo ka go ebi elkpin, fere jo lim elkohn abiafem ni bo jo noongo a ane ba ki fuumu re bo noongo a bo. Esowo ebko bo, lim ejum erehke, tib eji bo kpꞌnyehne erem bi ellulagun ni li go njinanjini.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Mbang nyꞌnehm nyi abaleemalem baa kpo lim abiafem tob agubjing ebo. Bo kpehme taame re, Esowo jo fili bo. Bo kpo su na ajꞌjok ane ba li go ero. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Jol Maikel ji li ntubesi enjel limem ano. Eji bo jo taange abola nnehm, fere jo lim nfaabe bade ekv ji Moses, Maikel sahbem su nnehm, fere lam-e. Ji á bungu no, á bungu re, “Nong, Esowo nyam-a!”<verse eid="JUD 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Wo, ane bao kpo su nsol nyi bo kil elkahne. Nsol nyehka nyehka nyi njini nyia, nyi nyi bo kpꞌkahne ana enyam ekulugbe kpꞌtob kahn nsol, nyio nyi kpꞌrannge bo.<verse eid="JUD 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Eyuu a bo! Tibre bo kpꞌjene go mbang nyi Ken.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 3:12</char></note> Bobyake elbo ka, fere kpꞌtoono mbang nyi Belam tane no tib go esi akpohko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Pit 2:15-16; Ell 2:14</char></note> Bobrannge ana Kora rannge no, ji lame kak Esowo. <verse eid="JUD 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Bo li ana anyakenyake adehbe go egahna nkak nyi ń kpo li tib elkoro ni ń kpi atemtem, tib eji bo kpi elrang lim. Jol ndon bo kpehme be. Bo kpo kpur elbo wo wo. Bo li ana akparesemsem nya kil jo na elahb, nya nfeb kpo kpu, tahm a nya. Bo li ana nti nyi kil jo kab akab ngare nyi nti kpo kab. Bo li ana nti nyi bo ma melle, nyi ma kpo nkpel ebal. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Bo li ana ebuku ji nne lꞌkꞌma lim re rahke. Nsol ndon nyi bo kpo lim kpꞌtibi ana nfahl ebuku. Bo li ana alonlo nya ma be elbal. Esowo ebtoobo edi ji nkom ejannge li no bum bo. Owo bo bahke woomo go njinanjini.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Enohk wo jolo nne no biingi ane asehma bomo goji Adam. Ye wo tob nyehn enyehnamahr jia bade elkohn ane baa re, “Nyehn ana Ntul ma ba a abarebare ane ebe ba li mbud a nkunu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 19:14</char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />re á ba lam ane kpee, fere tib ane kpee ba kil jo kak Esowo abꞌbi nsol nya bo lim-e no go mbang nyi bo lꞌkꞌkpe ma faabe, fere tib aneb abiafem ba kil jo kak Esowo alum kpee nya bo jo bung egban egban tob-e.” <verse eid="JUD 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Bo li ane ba kpo memme, ba ejum ajehng ajehng kil jo nob go bo esamahr. Bo kpꞌtoono nsol nyi kpo melle bo go bo a ntim. Bo kpo wor anyo kunu elbo, fere jo tehk ane go nnyo a nnyo, eji bo lꞌli bo nsehng.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buumen alum nya abatiingetib Jisos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Akpondahme, buumen enyehnamahr ji abatiingetib Jisos Kraist, Ntul ewahre jo nyehn. <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />Bo tong-n re, “Esꞌkohro ngare anyok ane bahke jolo, ba kpꞌtoono nsol nyi kpo melle bofono antahng go bo a ntim, nyi ki li nyi Esowo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tim 4:1; 2 Pit 3:3</char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Ane bao kpo ko nyꞌyabe ba a nyi. Bo li aneb njini. Etingi Etohko bo kpimm.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 5:22</char></note><verse eid="JUD 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Akpondahme enyame, jo kaken atemtem ebo, eji ń lꞌgbal go nsol nyi Esowo, nyi li abarebare nsol nya sahb bꞌbar. Jo kaken ero go nsahm nyi Etingi Etohko. <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />Jo kuuren elnahne, wahn sa ano go elkoro ni Esowo, eji ń kpꞌsiki Jisos Kraist Ntul ewahre no bahk-n kake elkpin ni li go njinanjini tib go ege a ndon. <verse eid="JUD 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Nong, ane ba kpo faabe jo fil-n ndon.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 1:46,50; 20:25,27</char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />Tahren egom jindiki yehke go agun.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jems 5:19-20</char></note> Jo tiben ndon nyi li semme elfahle. Nong, ewobo ji kpi adale nyao nya abiafem jo sab-n.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 3:4</char></note><verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jud tehke Esowo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24-25" />Nong, ellub, a agbal, a nsahm, a eko jol ka nne no bahk-n ma fili, ń kꞌgbo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:24-25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 22:31-32; 1 Kor 10:13</char></note> fere ko-n je a nahne go ege esamahr bi ellub ene, eji ń lꞌjol ane ba ki kpi ebi ajehng ajehng, fere jo bel eyebatahng. Ye wo li Esowo ntahngtahng, bi jolo mahne mahne, bi li anv, bi bahke jolo go njinanjini,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:24-25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 4:8; 21:6</char></note> ye ji tahr-r no sehng go abo nya Jisos Kraist Ntul ewahre. Emen.<verse eid="JUD 1:24-25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>